            "1 Taanv taanc kho! (2) ’niu Ravguangc bangc nunc e,",
            "Kaipouc tatpui chaeng khou ’niu nic lay tat di kho;",
            "Kalatdanv #<8 ’niu pumtan tiikaluanlou khang,",
            "Taanh khang ariwmei guay ngamvpatna taanc di kho.",
            "",
            "Taanc di kho!..taanc di kho! (2)",
            "Rigwn kho, .. changkhaanv kho!",
            "Taanc bam kho, Kaipouc guang mak saanv.",
            "",
            "2 Taanv taanc kho! (2) ’daapc mei ta tiitu kho,",
            "Ringhmei duipuak khou lakmei nunc ta zaylou kho;",
            "Katuang kros lev chuanghphey hei ’niu hym sw puni,",
            "“Ringhbamv nsaa tii the,” twmei chamv dinc bam khou.",
            "",
            "3 Taanv taanc kho! (2) meic guaykhang taanv nai e,",
            "Zinghmei guangcdic lev ’khuaimei guay ’maan kan puni,",
            "Poubauhmei zanc hei kauh liangsingmei sw puni,",
            "“Ringhbamv nsa tii the,” twna kauc thau pwkhou.",
            "",
            "4 Taanv taanc kho! (2) Kaipouc tuang pumtan khou,",
            "Guangh pyrun, guangh pheychuan aniu swan sw puni,",
            "Biangpiu mei nunc kai 8}@ aniu kai sw puni,",
